{
  "slug": "steuer",
  "name": "Steuer",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "German freelancer tax filing automated end-to-end. Steuer parses your Wise bank statements into structured transactions, classifies income and expenses into German tax categories, converts USD to EUR using official ECB reference rates (with full audit trail), generates a Finanzamt-ready PDF + CSV for your Einnahmen-Überschuss-Rechnung,  and walks you through filing via ELSTER line by line. All processing stays local — no data leaves your machine.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **3 skills**.\n\n- **Skills** (3): `calculate-euer` (Calculate the EÜR (Einnahmen-Überschuss-Rechnung) from verdict-classified transactions — convert USD to EUR via ECB rates and total by…), `elster-guide` (Interactive step-by-step guide for filling in German ELSTER tax forms), `parse-statements` (Parse bank transactions, net pre-auth/reversals per merchant, and classify each group via the verdict map)\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install steuer@claude-community` from `flykit-cc/flykit` (`plugins/steuer`).",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot",
    "antigravity",
    "codex"
  ],
